## Deployment Options

- [Managed Cloud Platform](https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform): Build and scale with an AI-ready, modern, multi-cloud platform.
- [Database](https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/atlas-database): Run fully managed, multi-cloud Atlas database service on AWS, Azure, and GCP.
- [Self-Managed](https://www.mongodb.com/products/self-managed/enterprise-advanced): Run and manage MongoDB yourself, ideal for regulated or on-premises environments.
- [Self-Managed](https://www.mongodb.com/products/self-managed/community-edition): Develop locally with MongoDB for learning, prototyping, and local development.

## Platform Services

- [Atlas Search](https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/atlas-search): Add full-text search directly on your operational data without a separate search engine.
- [Atlas Search Documentation](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/search.md)
- [Atlas Stream Processing](https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/atlas-stream-processing): Continuously read, transform, and route streaming data using the MongoDB aggregation pipeline.

### Artificial Intelligence and Search

- [Embedding and Reranking Models](https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/ai-search-and-retrieval): State-of-the-art AI model that can help developers to build semantic search, RAG, and agentic applications.
- [Voyage AI Documentation](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/voyageai.md)
- [Vector Search](https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/atlas-vector-search): Store embeddings alongside application data and run your queries in the same database.
- [Vector Search Documentation](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/vector-search.md)
- [Build with AI](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/build-with-ai.md)
