## Developer Tools

- [Compass](https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/compass): Free GUI tool for data exploration.
- [Atlas CLI](https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/atlas-cli): Command-line tool for managing Atlas.
- [MongoDB Shell](https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/shell): Programmatic solution to interact with your database.
- [Relational Migrator](https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/relational-migrator): Simplify your move to MongoDB.
- [Mongosync](https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/mongosync): Migrate data between separate MongoDB clusters.

