## Client Libraries
- [C#/.Net Driver](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/csharp/current/get-started.md): dotnet add package MongoDB.Driver. Supports both sync and async APIs.
- [PyMongo](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/languages/python/pymongo-driver/current/get-started.md): pip install pymongo. Sync and async (PyMongo Async API) support in one package.
- [Java Sync Driver](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/get-started.md): Maven (org.mongodb:mongodb-driver-sync) or Gradle. Synchronous/blocking API.
- [Go Driver](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/go/current/get-started.md): go get go.mongodb.org/mongo-driver/v2/mongo. Idiomatic Go API using bson.D/bson.M for documents.
- [ODMs and ORMs](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/odm.md): Mongoose (Node.js), Django MongoDB Backend (Python), MongoEngine (Python), Hibernate ORM extension (Java).

